The Physics Engine Collision
Star Trek Logic: Methodical, rank-bound, institutional, governed by protocol, sensor sweeps, and strict command chains.
Doctor Who Logic: Anarchic, individualistic, chaotic, running down corridors, governed by sonic screwdrivers, rapid-fire technobabble, and a complete refusal to acknowledge rank.
