Pairings & Collisions
1. The 4th Doctor + Captain Kirk (The "Rule-Breaker" Dynamic)
The Collision: Tom Baker’s Doctor strolling onto the Enterprise bridge, offering Spock a Jelly Baby, and casually bypassing the main computer's security protocols with a piece of wire.
The Dynamic: Kirk tries to pull rank, only to realize the Doctor doesn't recognize Starfleet authority. But the moment an alien threat appears, they instantly sync because both operate on pure, unadulterated tactical improvisation.
